{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>WARNING: This game contains visual and audio anomalies, disorienting effects, and psychological horror.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a decaying zone where time loops and reality fractures. The lights flicker. The corridors repeat. Something is deeply wrong\u2014and it's getting worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exit Zone</strong> is a memory-based anomaly horror game inspired by Exit 8, designed for <strong>1\u20135 players</strong>. Every corridor looks the same\u2014until it doesn\u2019t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe your surroundings. Memorize every room, object, sound, and corridor. Advance only when you're certain everything is normal\u2014then pull the <strong>green lever</strong>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If anything feels off, hit the <strong>red lever</strong> before it\u2019s too late. Anomalies can be subtle\u2026 or dangerous.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One wrong choice, and the zone resets\u2014or worse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254020/extras/129e91bcf142775ce2f5568df34480af.avif?t=1767540243\" width=616 height=265 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anomaly Observation Mechanics</strong>  <br>Spot shifting elements in the environment: misplaced objects, altered text, warped visuals, impossible physics, or entities that shouldn\u2019t exist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or Co-op Multiplayer (1\u20135 Players)</strong>  <br>Work together to share memory and identify anomalies\u2014or split up and risk it alone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized Runs</strong>  <br>Each playthrough generates new anomaly patterns, ensuring replayability and paranoia every time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Combat \u2013 Just Observation</strong>  <br>The only way out is to observe, remember, and choose the correct path.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254020/extras/c481272508224c4b560da1a55bf94098.avif?t=1767540243\" width=616 height=265 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Makes Exit Zone Different?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >True psychological tension \u2013 no cheap jumpscares.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A haunted world designed to sharpen your perception.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomalies escalate the longer you remain inside.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters. Every second counts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Do you remember where the door was? Are you sure that corpse wasn\u2019t here before?</i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One wrong choice, and you\u2019ll be part of the zone forever.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Exit Zone.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Zone Pensioner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3254020/28a250d4a01ecd0c53581f5b24586024a88a72c4.jpg"},{"name":"The Long Walk","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3254020/40e2cc8d2d1925022fe056ebfbdd3c58a4e64b20.jpg"},{"name":"First Field Trip","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3254020/7ff7b8ff3170023a30e9c31ab4649c98cb9e4135.jpg"},{"name":"A Hole in Reality (and the Floor)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3254020/7746fcd7cd60f03ff126c4444cb6c360c7678055.jpg"},{"name":"Trouble on the Tracks","path"